            <div xml:id="m-49d66d46-e241-40b0-a095-2270197d6373">
              <lg xml:id="m-6a6a1fa2-53cd-46bf-8a2b-1b43e4bbe86b">
                <l xml:id="m-e2948d36-b92f-41f0-9128-1319f09fb325" facs="#m-e90f7e89-c48d-4ab3-8c6e-a9bdffe5efed" label="text-like">Common of Apostles and Evangelists. P. T.</l><l xml:id="m-fc84b4f2-0022-437f-bcbd-066790c9693d" facs="#m-e490ac56-0132-4a80-8b06-a3348e2cd075" label="ambiguous">mo</l><l xml:id="m-9269cb36-6d45-44f1-a505-95b71248c9b0" facs="#m-b6a28a8f-d102-4946-9762-f229ca8f5d2e" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-b5867a08-0af0-4e78-840f-c55f46a094a3" facs="#m-c38d8d41-e285-475b-8bc7-e38f92297520" label="lyrics-like">Ant. In caeléstibus régnis. p. 1120. Psatms of Sunday. Chapter of</l><l xml:id="m-2565788a-0ede-4665-a5d0-c405ff963d62" facs="#m-258557bd-3a6a-4269-8974-08890136fc16" label="ambiguous">Vespers : Stabunt justi. p. 1121.</l><l xml:id="m-91010ee8-04d9-4eb5-8c04-b691e2dbbe1d" facs="#m-4521478e-3311-46d1-bd43-38ed12c01fab" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-798d2020-a752-42cd-b7f0-c092dc6a6264" facs="#m-50ae25b8-5730-4e19-8520-eabe5823b8bb" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-0597b9f6-7529-420e-bcc3-8071dfd85860" facs="#m-f2daad78-b1c4-4500-a341-16be2b8cc6fb" label="lyrics-like">Ancti et jústi in Dómino gaudé-te: “Alle-lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-51339c54-b4ec-4c61-b959-0607b72b90b9" facs="#m-e70a55aa-beb8-435e-86d3-bd1a9165703e" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia. V. Vos e-légit Dé-us in haeredi-tá-tem sí-bi.</l><l xml:id="m-ec01b597-7804-4509-8e8e-b3f8a286eb47" facs="#m-f7564763-7426-43fd-9ba2-242cf5848544" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-d4e1bd97-cddc-4ba8-8d88-85cbd8586185" facs="#m-0d577e1d-285d-44fd-9f68-85539da58653" label="lyrics-like">V. Lux perpétua lucébit Sánctis túis Dómine, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-9d19078d-ab21-44fd-96a5-851d70f2cb06" facs="#m-47c00a0d-15df-49b9-a6a2-f9ee858b2edd" label="lyrics-like">K. Et aetérnitas témporum, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-1c1d8b1a-4460-46db-a7fe-09ade557006a" facs="#m-a9e8306b-1b70-41a7-8456-8c9692f66180" label="text-like">The Masses are found in their respective places, in the Proper of Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-eec8f616-ef6f-4bc6-ad04-d78673f0a517" facs="#m-899faaaf-6156-41f8-85b6-8082b26cba0a" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-e08b07a9-c851-4f77-ba6f-7da87935b9ac" facs="#m-d6a462b2-9f52-4da3-a5c6-bc72fe50c450" label="lyrics-like">Ant. In velaménto. p. 1120. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-f2f6ed7c-0478-47f0-b761-87eee336c84b" facs="#m-423e52b8-a5df-4e1f-abac-e9f0c682f90d" label="ambiguous">Wisd. 5.</l><l xml:id="m-72a42140-3a48-4824-a5d1-a435e71d8a3f" facs="#m-1a6b2022-6903-4a49-a41b-c13f5dd14012" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-35248aae-0369-4e9b-8269-73a7e0774288" facs="#m-bba84d9f-e7c1-4dfe-9f4f-0d938d8524d8" label="lyrics-like">yCce quómodo computáti sunt ctos sors illórum est.</l><l xml:id="m-dcfe3f07-33fe-4d11-88aa-2b6257cff337" facs="#m-a9123791-7233-45bb-839f-2b6dd6a1d2f3" label="ambiguous">U inter filios Dei,“ et inter San¬</l><l xml:id="m-257dac89-8fa1-49ec-9d3d-f1cf1c5f78dc" facs="#m-5f6cdc82-ab33-47fd-9538-589b6ee88ced" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-b8dcb846-48e5-435f-acf1-eb06cd3451e8" facs="#m-837eb361-2bc6-4c04-8148-bd4fa457c3d1" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-0f3c2879-2507-4c3c-bc11-27caa5d0bf40" facs="#m-3d46306c-f17f-402c-a416-5217d6b348ad" label="lyrics-like">AUX perpé-tu-a lucébit Sánctis tú-is Dómine:</l><l xml:id="m-a12bff1c-20ab-42a3-ba2f-1ca86feaba5c" facs="#m-d6fb19a0-6ef3-4a21-82eb-924840e6d7d7" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. V. Et aetérni-tas témporum. Gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b8992bd-01a4-422c-921d-b3e34d768e62" facs="#m-74000b93-6b93-44b3-b40b-a2bcca79aa2b" label="lyrics-like">ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-67e88368-0723-45b6-9c14-64aa41e1f6a5" facs="#m-cf0ef936-ed97-4817-8326-91e14f8bed75" label="lyrics-like">V. Laetítia sempitérna super cápita eórum, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-15884940-3d20-414e-b582-1bd8017761bb" facs="#m-f92ec4e9-0614-4145-8617-c4bbd85701c2" label="lyrics-like">R. Gáudium et exsultatiónem obtinébunt, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-fd22485c-213b-43f3-9bf3-1825436130d3" facs="#m-8269e113-484b-495b-a7d9-bb184678bf22" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-73afab70-967d-4823-bcab-bb07a3395899" facs="#m-0b8b9805-74b8-459a-8922-658d2b00079b" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Fulgébunt jústi. p. 121. Psaims of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-c8081950-8cfd-4872-ac05-5ce0c85ef60a" facs="#m-ba42b8b8-354d-4bcb-85ea-5ca01e1bee10" label="ambiguous">Rom. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-5b24b07b-4235-4fa1-aebb-d1b459e862ae" facs="#m-d3b00b09-f625-4427-9327-58424129337b" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-1405dcb3-8ef4-4d69-8e18-0848bd8aa669" facs="#m-f04b9e82-4d46-4a8a-9957-1c87824f32c2" label="lyrics-like">YCimus quóniam diligéntibus bonum, “iis qui secúndum propó¬</l><l xml:id="m-201fec82-d884-4a63-8c86-45c321c122cf" facs="#m-3b8fb550-8515-4764-ad4c-f5d568f37b68" label="lyrics-like">O Deum t ómnia cooperántur in situm vocáti sunt sancti.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>